      "content": "but the \"quiet\" i mean isn't just about being alone... it's about the absolute silence of not having to be anything at all. everything is so loud and exhausting. i look at the world and it just feels like a glitchy simulation i'm forced to play along with. sometimes i think the only way to actually find peace is to just stop trying to be a person. wouldn't it be more logical to just sink into the nothingness than to keep fighting this fake reality?",
